WEBVTT

00:01.810 --> 00:06.260
<i>It's winter, and my first year at 
the academy is nearing its end.</i>

00:07.430 --> 00:10.550
<i>People have only grown more scared 
of me since the martial arts competition,</i>

00:10.550 --> 00:12.870
<i>putting my loner status on full display.</i>

00:14.280 --> 00:15.620
Morning, Yumiella.

00:16.810 --> 00:17.750
Good morning.

00:18.260 --> 00:21.920
<i>I can't remember the last time 
I spoke to anyone but Patrick.</i>

00:22.290 --> 00:26.640
<i>But I haven't had to deal with Alicia or 
the conquerable characters for a while,</i>

00:26.640 --> 00:28.110
<i>so life is peaceful.</i>

00:28.500 --> 00:30.890
<i>Or so I thought...</i>

00:31.340 --> 00:34.310
Alicia's belongings have 
been going missing lately.

00:34.310 --> 00:35.960
Do you know anything?

00:35.960 --> 00:38.140
<i>So long, my brief moment of peace.</i>

00:38.870 --> 00:39.850
I don't.

00:39.850 --> 00:41.090
Are you sure?

00:41.090 --> 00:44.990
You'd be better off confessing 
now than getting exposed later.

00:44.990 --> 00:45.780
Your Highness!

00:46.050 --> 00:49.780
I don't think it's right to assume 
someone is guilty without any evidence.

00:52.030 --> 00:54.220
There's someone else I have my doubts about.

00:54.220 --> 00:56.450
I'll look into them first.

00:56.940 --> 00:58.540
You're not going to ask me?

00:59.190 --> 01:02.030
I know you couldn't have done it, Ashbatten.

01:05.790 --> 01:08.970
<i>In the game, I'm the one who bullies Alicia.</i>

01:09.360 --> 01:11.840
<i>But of course, I didn't do this.</i>

01:12.220 --> 01:14.850
<i>Which means it must have been someone else.</i>

01:15.690 --> 01:18.810
<i>There are many at the academy 
who dislike Alicia.</i>

01:19.190 --> 01:21.230
<i>Because she's a commoner,</i>

01:21.790 --> 01:24.980
<i>because she's close to the 
prince and his buddies...</i>

01:25.230 --> 01:29.610
<i>If the bullying escalates and 
Alicia stops coming to school...</i>

01:32.770 --> 01:35.410
<i>It could have a negative impact 
on my leveling progress.</i>

01:36.210 --> 01:37.370
<i>This calls for a stakeout.</i>

02:02.280 --> 02:05.900
<b>Villainess Level 99</b>

02:02.700 --> 02:05.900
I May Be the Hidden Boss but I'm Not the Demon Lord

03:18.430 --> 03:20.010
What are you doing?

03:20.010 --> 03:21.800
U-Um...

03:21.800 --> 03:23.050
You've got it all wrong!

03:23.050 --> 03:27.660
I was just worried about... 
Miss... Alicia...

03:34.440 --> 03:36.360
M-Miss Yumiella...

03:36.930 --> 03:39.470
P-Please don't kill me!

03:39.470 --> 03:41.440
<i>I'm forever asking myself...</i>

03:41.440 --> 03:43.970
<i>Just what do people think I am?</i>

03:43.970 --> 03:45.370
<b>Demon
Lord</b>

03:45.370 --> 03:48.540
I was only doing it for Miss Eleonora!

03:53.290 --> 03:57.260
And you think I ordered her to do that?

03:58.140 --> 04:02.890
No, I only came to inform you that 
your friend was doing something bad.

04:03.200 --> 04:06.640
She did admit that she did 
it of her own accord.

04:07.950 --> 04:08.870
But...

04:09.770 --> 04:12.610
If Prince Edwin hears about this,

04:13.030 --> 04:16.190
he might think she was 
acting on your orders.

04:18.370 --> 04:23.140
I don't think you should punish her. 
It would make others suspicious.

04:23.140 --> 04:25.690
I intend to keep quiet about it, as well.

04:25.690 --> 04:27.700
U-Um...

04:28.200 --> 04:31.580
But then Miss Alicia and 
Prince Edwin will...

04:31.580 --> 04:33.220
I doubt anything will happen.

04:33.540 --> 04:36.260
A commoner can't marry 
into the royal family.

04:36.260 --> 04:38.380
Y-Yes, that's a good point!

04:38.810 --> 04:40.030
<i>I lied.</i>

04:40.030 --> 04:41.890
<i>If Alicia defeats the Demon Lord,</i>

04:41.890 --> 04:44.200
<i>the king will regard her as the 
second coming of the saint</i>

04:44.200 --> 04:45.930
<i>and have her marry the prince.</i>

04:47.380 --> 04:51.270
Which is why I recommend 
ignoring Miss Alicia.

04:51.270 --> 04:55.510
You wouldn't want to suffer a setback 
over something as silly as this.

04:55.510 --> 04:59.780
Of course! But why did you tell me all this?

05:00.330 --> 05:05.030
Because I'm praying that you and 
Prince Edwin find happiness.

05:05.630 --> 05:06.780
Oh!

05:07.290 --> 05:09.710
You really do have good judgment!

05:09.710 --> 05:13.480
Anyone can see that I'm the one 
who's best suited for Prince Edwin!

05:10.480 --> 05:11.480
<i>She's too easy.</i>

05:11.790 --> 05:13.830
<i>Stop the bullying of Alicia,</i>

05:13.480 --> 05:15.550
I guess you feel the same way!

05:13.830 --> 05:16.300
<i>and protect the responsible party...</i>

05:16.300 --> 05:18.550
<i>I've achieved both of those goals.</i>

05:20.070 --> 05:22.370
That's kind of unusual for you.

05:22.370 --> 05:23.610
How so?

05:23.610 --> 05:27.120
Normally, I would've expected 
you to turn in the culprit.

05:27.470 --> 05:31.170
Wouldn't getting Prince Edwin to scold 
Miss Eleonora resolve everything?

05:32.630 --> 05:33.850
Well...

05:34.630 --> 05:38.400
She might have been me...

05:39.480 --> 05:40.810
What does that mean?

05:40.810 --> 05:44.790
If a version of me that 
kept her dark magic secret

05:44.790 --> 05:49.150
and never did any leveling up 
lived in some other world...

05:50.420 --> 05:55.010
If the parents I'd never even met 
told me to befriend other nobles,

05:55.010 --> 05:58.340
I might have been desperate to get Miss 
Eleonora to let me join her clique.

05:58.870 --> 06:01.490
I would have been her number one underling,

06:01.930 --> 06:04.990
the one she'd force to do things 
no one else wanted to do.

06:06.220 --> 06:07.970
Alicia

06:06.220 --> 06:07.970
(Hey, is that... my desk?)

06:07.970 --> 06:10.470
Edwin

06:07.970 --> 06:10.470
Why don't you explain yourself?
What were you trying to do to Alicia?!

06:08.260 --> 06:10.860
I'd be forced to do all the bullying,

06:10.470 --> 06:13.850
Yumiella

06:10.470 --> 06:13.850
(There was nobody on my side.)

06:10.860 --> 06:13.850
and when I got caught, Eleonora 
would run me out of her group,

06:14.570 --> 06:16.740
and I'd have no one on my side.

06:17.090 --> 06:22.490
I'd hate my parents, I'd hate 
Eleonora, I'd hate Alicia...

06:23.450 --> 06:25.070
<i>Alicia Ehnleit.</i>

06:25.590 --> 06:28.820
<i>She has light magic, and I have dark magic.</i>

06:29.240 --> 06:32.410
<i>She is loved by all, and I am loved by none.</i>

06:32.930 --> 06:36.960
<i>Maybe the Yumiella in the game is 
actually the victim in this world...</i>

06:38.630 --> 06:42.050
Then I'd start leveling up 
in order to get revenge.

06:42.470 --> 06:44.760
But dark is weak against light,

06:44.760 --> 06:48.940
Alicia

06:44.760 --> 06:48.940
Miss Yumiella?! But why...

06:45.540 --> 06:47.870
so in the end, Alicia would kill me.

06:49.810 --> 06:51.940
I started thinking about what-ifs like that,

06:51.940 --> 06:54.020
and it made me want to help her.

06:56.000 --> 07:00.680
What? I was only speaking hypothetically 
about a world like that existing.

07:01.890 --> 07:03.480
There's no difference.

07:03.480 --> 07:04.030
Huh?

07:05.260 --> 07:10.780
The only difference between the you here 
and the hypothetical you is your level.

07:11.550 --> 07:13.690
That's a big difference, though.

07:14.520 --> 07:16.710
Do you have anyone on your side now?

07:17.910 --> 07:19.460
Do you hate this world?

07:20.310 --> 07:21.670
If you do, I...

07:24.400 --> 07:29.680
It's all right. Just having an acquaintance 
to talk to every now and then is enough.

07:31.070 --> 07:32.430
I see...

07:33.230 --> 07:35.950
I should head back to the dorm now. See you.

07:35.950 --> 07:38.440
Okay... See you tomorrow.

07:39.170 --> 07:42.940
<i>Just getting a conversation 
partner was hard enough.</i>

07:44.230 --> 07:46.470
<i>I don't know if I'll ever make a friend,</i>

07:46.840 --> 07:49.850
<i>and I can't even imagine 
getting a romantic partner.</i>

07:52.950 --> 07:54.870
An acquaintance, huh?

07:57.150 --> 07:58.460
<i>A few days later...</i>

07:58.460 --> 08:01.210
Miss Yumiella! We meet again!

08:01.610 --> 08:06.390
<i>Ever since the bullying incident, 
Eleonora's been following me around.</i>

08:06.390 --> 08:07.840
What a coincidence.

08:07.840 --> 08:10.490
I was just about to have tea!

08:10.490 --> 08:12.990
I'll invite you as a special exception!

08:12.990 --> 08:16.150
<i>These "special exceptions" have 
been going on for three days now.</i>

08:17.130 --> 08:19.650
I'm sorry. I have things I need to do.

08:21.200 --> 08:22.680
<i>I'm genuinely scared.</i>

08:22.680 --> 08:25.630
<i>I have no idea what Eleonora is thinking.</i>

08:25.990 --> 08:27.570
<i>According to the queen,</i>

08:27.570 --> 08:30.490
<i>the leader of the anti-king 
faction is Duke Hillrose.</i>

08:31.240 --> 08:35.150
<i>And Eleonora's his daughter.
I'd rather not get close to her.</i>

08:36.690 --> 08:39.290
<i>All right, I need to just 
turn her down flat.</i>

08:39.290 --> 08:41.950
<i>If it makes her hate me,
 I'll just have to deal with it.</i>

08:41.950 --> 08:45.820
Miss Eleonora, I would appreciate 
it if you'd stop inviting me.

08:45.820 --> 08:47.260
But why?

08:47.940 --> 08:49.930
I have delicious sweets, too.

08:49.930 --> 08:51.890
<i>Level 99 craftiness!</i>

08:51.890 --> 08:56.280
If you're friendly with me, 
Prince Edwin won't like you.

08:56.280 --> 08:58.150
I don't want that!

08:58.150 --> 09:00.100
Could you help me out?

09:00.100 --> 09:02.020
<i>She's not making sense at all.</i>

09:02.290 --> 09:05.130
Fine, I'll go. Will that make you happy?

09:05.130 --> 09:06.490
Terribly happy!

09:06.490 --> 09:08.370
<i>I can't take her anymore.</i>

09:11.360 --> 09:13.910
Here, Miss Yumiella. Eat some of these.

09:14.750 --> 09:15.890
Very well.

09:18.220 --> 09:19.650
What do you think?

09:19.650 --> 09:22.510
I'm... not sure. It doesn't taste like much.

09:22.510 --> 09:24.670
It certainly doesn't taste bad, but...

09:25.650 --> 09:27.420
It doesn't taste that good, either.

09:27.670 --> 09:30.950
I'm the one who made those, you know!

09:31.860 --> 09:33.550
<i>Now's my chance to make her hate me!</i>

09:34.200 --> 09:38.930
Ah, no wonder. I thought it 
tasted kind of disgusting.

09:42.010 --> 09:45.190
<i>If I say they taste good, 
she'll get clingy again.</i>

09:45.600 --> 09:47.480
<i>Come on! Get mad!</i>

09:48.290 --> 09:49.910
Yes, you're right!

09:49.910 --> 09:52.200
This was a failed batch, 
if I'm being honest!

09:52.650 --> 09:53.660
Huh?

09:54.080 --> 09:58.770
But my friends all say they're the 
most delicious things in the world.

09:58.770 --> 10:02.120
You're the only one who tells me the truth!

10:02.520 --> 10:06.130
<i>Wait... Did I make the wrong choice?</i>

10:06.590 --> 10:10.890
Um... Why did you suddenly 
decide to start baking?

10:11.620 --> 10:16.140
I heard that Miss Alicia gave 
Prince Edwin homemade sweets.

10:16.460 --> 10:18.140
So I thought I would, too.

10:18.730 --> 10:22.780
<i>Homemade sweets, huh?
Ever the skilled communicator.</i>

10:22.780 --> 10:24.040
<i>Wait, no!</i>

10:24.040 --> 10:26.940
<i>What I need now is the resolve 
to make her hate me!</i>

10:27.540 --> 10:30.130
I don't think you need to do that.

10:30.130 --> 10:32.940
In fact, I don't think it's possible for you.

10:32.940 --> 10:35.090
Yes, of course!

10:35.090 --> 10:38.360
I did it because all my 
friends said I should,

10:38.360 --> 10:40.700
but it's not at all like me, is it?

10:41.200 --> 10:42.080
Huh?

10:42.080 --> 10:46.210
You understand me so well, Miss Yumiella!

10:46.910 --> 10:49.960
<i>There's some bug happening 
that makes her like me more</i>

10:49.960 --> 10:51.710
<i>the harder I try to make her hate me.</i>

10:52.200 --> 10:57.590
All my friends think I could never make 
a mistake because I'm so perfect.

10:58.030 --> 10:59.550
If our opinions differ,

10:59.550 --> 11:03.590
they decide that I must be 
right and they must be wrong.

11:03.220 --> 11:05.980
<i>They're just scared they'll 
get on your bad side.</i>

11:03.590 --> 11:05.980
I'm such a terrible woman!

11:06.720 --> 11:09.730
<i>And she's so stupidly gullible,</i>

11:10.130 --> 11:13.580
<i>I actually worry someone might 
manipulate her for evil purposes.</i>

11:11.030 --> 11:13.990
That's what they all say, anyway!

11:14.950 --> 11:17.790
<i>Maybe someone already is manipulating her?</i>

11:18.530 --> 11:22.990
<i>Like, what if someone's ordered 
her to get rid of Alicia?</i>

11:23.320 --> 11:27.360
I wanted to ask about when that girl hid 
Miss Alicia's things the other day.

11:27.360 --> 11:31.890
I-I wasn't the one who ordered 
her to do that... I, um...

11:32.400 --> 11:36.200
<i>No, it's obvious the final 
order came from Eleonora.</i>

11:36.200 --> 11:39.260
<i>The question is, who put 
her up to it, and why?</i>

11:39.970 --> 11:44.010
What did you think about it, then?

11:44.010 --> 11:46.460
About hiding Miss Alicia's things.

11:46.460 --> 11:48.270
I-I...

11:48.880 --> 11:51.560
I didn't think it was a very good thing.

11:51.960 --> 11:55.280
But they said it was the best thing to do...

11:55.830 --> 11:59.370
<i>The idea to bully Alicia came 
from one of her followers.</i>

11:59.730 --> 12:01.630
<i>The rest of them fell in line,</i>

12:01.630 --> 12:04.870
<i>and Eleonora was just convinced 
that they had to do it.</i>

12:05.710 --> 12:09.670
<i>So it doesn't seem like it's 
part of some bigger conspiracy.</i>

12:10.180 --> 12:12.300
<i>I was misled by her bloodline,</i>

12:12.300 --> 12:15.170
<i>but Eleonora isn't a bad 
girl... I don't think.</i>

12:17.010 --> 12:20.040
You shouldn't trust your friends too much.

12:20.040 --> 12:20.990
Oh!

12:20.990 --> 12:25.180
It won't be a problem at all 
if you become my friend!

12:25.810 --> 12:27.060
<i>Not happening.</i>

12:27.480 --> 12:30.970
I want to get all kinds of advice from you

12:30.970 --> 12:33.720
about my relationship with Prince Edwin!

12:33.720 --> 12:36.660
I don't know much about 
that sort of thing...

12:37.210 --> 12:37.900
But...

12:38.470 --> 12:43.660
You said there was no question that Prince 
Edwin and I would marry, didn't you?

12:44.000 --> 12:47.110
<i>I can't tell her I was lying...</i>

12:47.650 --> 12:49.750
<i>How did it come to this?</i>

12:52.910 --> 12:54.420
<i>Then, a few days later...</i>

12:57.170 --> 13:01.310
Miss Yumiella! I've come to visit you!

13:01.310 --> 13:05.090
Wow, you're actually inviting 
yourself over to my room now?

13:07.750 --> 13:09.030
Why did you let her in?

13:09.400 --> 13:12.690
I couldn't refuse the 
daughter of Duke Hillrose.

13:15.990 --> 13:19.130
Huh? This isn't the tea we usually have.

13:19.130 --> 13:22.820
I can't serve cheap tea to the 
daughter of Duke Hillrose.

13:23.270 --> 13:24.870
It's delicious!

13:27.120 --> 13:29.660
What is that girl's deal?

13:29.660 --> 13:33.460
I tried talking to her a bit, too. 
She doesn't seem like a bad person.

13:33.920 --> 13:36.630
Maybe you could try 
approaching her yourself.

13:38.400 --> 13:39.630
I'll think about it.

13:41.290 --> 13:42.420
Well, see you.

13:42.860 --> 13:43.940
Hang on a sec.

13:46.170 --> 13:48.890
Are you going to the party for 
the end of the school year?

13:49.110 --> 13:51.490
No. I'm not interested.

13:51.890 --> 13:53.020
Oh... Okay.

13:54.490 --> 13:56.730
If you change your mind, 
feel free to come by.

13:58.670 --> 14:00.930
<i>The year-end party...</i>

14:01.500 --> 14:06.040
<i>I hear it's an actual soirée meant to help 
us practice for joining high society.</i>

14:06.350 --> 14:09.540
<i>It has nothing to do with me, 
so I think I can skip it.</i>

14:09.540 --> 14:17.460
Edwin

14:09.540 --> 14:17.460
Alicia, let's go someplace where we can be alone.

14:10.220 --> 14:14.430
<i>But in the game, it includes an event 
where the heroine leaves the party</i>

14:14.430 --> 14:17.460
<i>with the character who has the 
highest affection rating.</i>

14:18.270 --> 14:22.910
<i>It'd be my chance to make sure Alicia 
is actually following Edwin's route.</i>

14:23.690 --> 14:25.710
Maybe I will drop by.

14:25.710 --> 14:28.630
Miss Yumiella! Have you picked 
out a dress for the party?

14:28.630 --> 14:29.680
There she is!

14:30.310 --> 14:32.420
We can't just wear our uniforms?

14:32.420 --> 14:34.250
Absolutely not!

14:34.250 --> 14:37.110
You wear a beautiful dress and dance!

14:37.530 --> 14:39.230
But I don't have a partner.

14:39.230 --> 14:39.570
Huh?

14:40.500 --> 14:41.690
What about Master Patrick?

14:42.040 --> 14:45.450
<i>Why did Patrick's name 
come up in this scenario?</i>

14:46.630 --> 14:49.200
<i>I've learned how to dance in class.</i>

14:49.200 --> 14:52.510
<i>And with the physical abilities 
I have thanks to being level 99,</i>

14:52.510 --> 14:54.460
<i>I imagine I'd make a pretty 
slick dancer, but...</i>

14:55.050 --> 14:57.020
Patrick has nothing to do with me.

14:57.020 --> 14:59.020
Also, I don't have a dress.

14:59.020 --> 15:01.460
Then I'll let you borrow one of mine!

15:01.850 --> 15:03.610
Let's choose one together!

15:03.610 --> 15:06.400
Actually, I might have one 
after all, so that's okay.

15:06.400 --> 15:08.790
Your room it is, then!

15:08.790 --> 15:09.510
Why?!

15:12.280 --> 15:13.980
You want a dress?!

15:14.780 --> 15:16.840
<i>Does she have to be </i>that<i> shocked?</i>

15:16.840 --> 15:17.940
I'm here to visit!

15:18.690 --> 15:21.180
I need one for the year-end party.

15:21.550 --> 15:22.940
Do I have any dresses?

15:23.550 --> 15:26.090
If not, I'm fine with wearing my uniform.

15:26.090 --> 15:28.890
Absolutely not! This is a party!

15:28.890 --> 15:29.970
Exactly!

15:29.970 --> 15:31.230
Let's do your makeup, as well!

15:31.230 --> 15:32.240
Let's!

15:32.460 --> 15:34.120
Makeup isn't necessary...

15:34.360 --> 15:35.930
Worry not!

15:35.930 --> 15:38.320
I practiced on my younger sister back home,

15:38.320 --> 15:40.610
so I know I can handle hair and makeup!

15:41.100 --> 15:42.380
So once again...

15:43.210 --> 15:44.380
Do I have any dresses?

15:47.390 --> 15:49.180
You do have some, but...

15:52.690 --> 15:54.290
How lovely.

15:54.290 --> 15:57.390
I just adore how extravagant all 
these frills and ribbons are.

15:57.890 --> 16:01.940
It looks like you have a solid 
collection of children's dresses.

16:02.810 --> 16:05.190
The lady of the house ordered them.

16:05.540 --> 16:07.440
<i>I know I've never met my mother,</i>

16:07.440 --> 16:09.820
<i>but just how old does she think I am?</i>

16:10.290 --> 16:12.660
Miss Dolkness, delivery for you.

16:12.660 --> 16:14.080
I'll get that.

16:14.080 --> 16:16.230
This one is cute, though!

16:17.270 --> 16:19.790
Sorry to say it, but I'll 
skip the party after all.

16:19.790 --> 16:22.750
Wait, no! We still have my dresses!

16:23.110 --> 16:27.070
<i>"Sorry to say it"? It's not as if 
I was looking forward to it...</i>

16:27.520 --> 16:30.660
<i>So why did I feel sorry for saying that?</i>

16:32.860 --> 16:34.390
It's from the queen.

16:34.390 --> 16:36.580
Huh? The queen?

16:37.010 --> 16:40.100
She does send me sweets every now and then.

16:40.100 --> 16:43.000
This one is bigger than usual, though.

16:43.000 --> 16:46.390
<i>Don't tell me... Could 
she time it that well?</i>

16:57.890 --> 17:00.640
Miss Yumiella, you look lovely!

17:00.640 --> 17:01.460
Thank you.

17:04.430 --> 17:05.250
<i>There she is.</i>

17:06.320 --> 17:08.470
<i>Looks like the event hasn't 
been triggered yet.</i>

17:09.380 --> 17:12.330
Didn't you ask Master Patrick to escort you?

17:12.820 --> 17:15.540
Why would you bring up Patrick?

17:15.540 --> 17:17.350
What? I mean, aren't you...

17:17.630 --> 17:18.580
Yumiella!

17:30.740 --> 17:33.130
I-I wouldn't want to get in your way!

17:33.130 --> 17:35.090
I'll just be over there!

17:35.090 --> 17:37.240
<i>No one asked you to be considerate.</i>

17:38.200 --> 17:40.590
<i>Patrick and I are only acquaintances.</i>

17:40.930 --> 17:42.500
<i>That's how he feels, too...</i>

17:43.130 --> 17:44.130
So you came.

17:44.470 --> 17:46.920
I decided I might as well participate.

17:47.450 --> 17:50.580
I was just thinking I should 
leave after all, though.

17:52.050 --> 17:55.760
I just feel kind of embarrassed 
in this dress...

17:58.450 --> 17:59.270
What is it?

18:00.400 --> 18:02.140
N-Nothing.

18:02.530 --> 18:04.530
<i>It's obviously not nothing.</i>

18:04.960 --> 18:08.370
Really, what's wrong?
Were you looking for someone?

18:08.370 --> 18:09.540
It's nothing.

18:09.540 --> 18:10.930
Where's Alicia?

18:10.930 --> 18:12.530
I can't find Ed, either!

18:12.810 --> 18:14.530
Did the two of them slip out?!

18:14.530 --> 18:15.810
Let's go look for them!

18:17.130 --> 18:19.540
<i>Well, I've achieved my goal in coming here.</i>

18:24.430 --> 18:26.770
I can't believe we went through with that.

18:26.770 --> 18:29.730
Will and Oz must be flipping out right now.

18:30.130 --> 18:33.720
I found a place where the 
stars look just amazing.

18:33.720 --> 18:36.050
I really wanted to show it to you.

18:37.110 --> 18:40.540
I never would have guessed 
you could be so bold.

18:40.540 --> 18:43.290
Yeah. I'm a little surprised myself.

18:47.500 --> 18:49.590
Well, I think I'll go now.

18:51.310 --> 18:52.440
Wait!

18:59.410 --> 19:01.580
Um... Just for one song...

19:02.850 --> 19:04.210
Would you dance with me?

19:05.740 --> 19:08.230
<i>He looks like such a noble right now.</i>

19:08.230 --> 19:11.470
<i>I should probably say, 
"With pleasure," or something.</i>

19:12.950 --> 19:13.970
Sure...

19:14.790 --> 19:18.350
<i>Well, that came out sounding awfully curt.</i>

19:20.030 --> 19:21.350
That's so like you.

19:22.350 --> 19:24.630
<i>But he laughed it off, so I guess it's okay.</i>

19:34.130 --> 19:37.170
<i>In my head, I'm pretty sure 
I'm dancing perfectly,</i>

19:37.170 --> 19:40.120
<i>so why do we feel so mismatched?</i>

19:40.650 --> 19:44.120
<i>I envy Patrick for taking 
the lead so flawlessly.</i>

19:45.680 --> 19:48.540
Relax a little. It's okay 
if you step on my toes.

19:48.810 --> 19:49.990
Even if I crush them?

19:49.990 --> 19:52.800
Don't! Stepping on and 
stomping on aren't the same!

19:56.450 --> 19:58.300
<i>My body's starting to move.</i>

20:03.020 --> 20:04.810
<i>This might be fun.</i>

20:05.880 --> 20:07.270
<i>I wonder why...</i>

20:10.870 --> 20:12.310
<i>Oh, well.</i>

20:19.120 --> 20:20.410
They're staring too much.

20:20.410 --> 20:22.050
Huh? Are they?

20:22.050 --> 20:25.050
Like they think this dress is stained 
with the blood of my enemies,

20:25.050 --> 20:28.350
or like they're shocked to 
see a battle robot dancing.

20:28.350 --> 20:30.130
Robo... huh?

20:30.520 --> 20:33.590
I'm saying that's what 
they're talking about.

20:33.590 --> 20:35.000
I can tell without even hearing them.

20:36.320 --> 20:37.010
No.

20:37.840 --> 20:39.630
It's because you look beautiful.

20:39.630 --> 20:40.510
Wha—

20:41.240 --> 20:42.550
<i>Calm down.</i>

20:42.550 --> 20:45.910
<i>I'm not the type to swing between giddy 
and depressed over empty compliments.</i>

20:46.730 --> 20:47.270
<i>But...</i>

20:47.970 --> 20:50.270
<i>My palms are getting sweaty! What do I do?</i>

20:51.210 --> 20:54.940
Saying that to just anyone will 
make people lose trust in you.

20:54.940 --> 20:57.260
Well, I mean, you are kind of dense...

20:57.610 --> 21:01.150
You know I can't come up with clever 
responses to empty compliments.

21:01.640 --> 21:04.200
Or maybe I'm the one who's dense.

21:04.510 --> 21:07.160
I finally realized today... that I...

21:11.810 --> 21:12.140
Scoot

21:12.930 --> 21:13.560
Wipe Wipe

21:14.050 --> 21:15.630
Um... what?

21:15.630 --> 21:19.510
Oh! It's not that I didn't want to 
hold hands... I just got sweaty...

21:20.370 --> 21:22.730
I know. It's nothing.

21:23.090 --> 21:24.890
<i>He looks a little unhappy.</i>

21:25.230 --> 21:27.350
<i>I'm sorry I suck at dancing.</i>

21:28.130 --> 21:29.140
Patrick...

21:29.780 --> 21:32.440
If you don't mind... maybe 
for the next song, too...

21:35.210 --> 21:36.250
Miss Yumiella.

21:37.550 --> 21:39.320
Would you dance with me?

21:39.560 --> 21:40.230
Huh?

21:41.740 --> 21:45.180
<i>Sorry, but I won't dance with 
anyone other than Patrick.</i>

21:45.180 --> 21:48.040
<i>Time for my finishing shut-down line!</i>

21:48.710 --> 21:52.120
I'm only into people who 
are stronger than me.

21:52.830 --> 21:54.650
Uh... R-Right...

21:54.650 --> 21:55.920
I'm so sorry!

21:56.970 --> 21:58.920
<i>Good. I turned him away.</i>

21:59.270 --> 22:01.920
Into... people who are... stronger...

22:02.800 --> 22:03.690
You okay?

22:04.980 --> 22:09.930
<b>The Hidden Boss Attempts Dancing</b>
